342: \paragraph{Expansion by corrected positions.}
343: Let $\mathcal E=\{(g,e):e\in E_g\}$ be the set of slot locations and
344: $N=|\mathcal E|$.  It is uniformly polynomial.  In the density
345: calculation for each gate, substitute $X+\Delta$ for each source
346: operator inside its sum over ket and bra labels.  Expanding these
347: products throughout the circuit gives
348: \begin{equation}
349:  \widehat\rho-\rho'
350:        =\sum_{\varnothing\ne S\subseteq\mathcal E}F_S.
351:  \label{eq:compression-subset-expansion}
352: \end{equation}
353: A set $S$ specifies which \emph{positions} use centered corrections;
354: it does not specify their monomial labels.  At a gate with no selected
355: position, summing its labels gives exactly $G_g(.)G_g^\dagger$.
356: 
357: Fix $S$, write $s=|S|$, and let $\mathcal A$ be the parties which are
358: endpoints of its slots.  Then $|\mathcal A|\le2s$.  Expand the ket and
359: bra labels at every nonprivate gate touching $\mathcal A$, whether or
360: not that gate has a selected slot.  There are at most $2bs$ such gates.
361: All other gates lie entirely in the exterior and remain their exact
362: aggregate contractions.  Also fix ket and bra basis entries $x,y$ of
363: the physical outputs at parties in $\mathcal A$.  The total weighted
364: cost of these choices is at most
365: \begin{equation}
366:  B(L)^{4bs}d(L)^{4s}=Q(L)^s,
367:  \qquad Q(L):=B(L)^{4b}d(L)^4.
368:  \label{eq:compression-choice-cost}
369: \end{equation}
370: Here each expanded gate contributes at most
371: $(\sum_\xi|c_{g,\xi}|)^2$; the number of physical matrix entries is at
372: most $d(L)^{2|\mathcal A|}$.  Scalar coefficients are removed from the
373: maps and charged in this bound.
374: 
